/// Unrestricted read, for admins and for managers granted organisation-wide
/// scope (FR-SEC-04).
///
/// No table permissions are declared, which in Power BI means no rows are
/// filtered out. Membership should be small and reviewed - this role sees every
/// employee's ratings and history.
///
/// Assign the Skills-Admins Entra security group to this role.
role 'Organisation Wide'
	modelPermission: read
